anges do not affect value until rearm. Factory staticmethods: int(default=0)->_int, float->_float, bool->_bool, str->_str, str_or_none()->lambda v: v (returns None when unset), int_or_none(), choice(default, choices). New config DEEPINFER_LOG_MAX_MESSAGE_CHARS can follow str_or_none/int_or_none style but must validate >=32 and add a factory (e.g. EnvVar factory method) parsing int and raising ValueError mentioning the name; __get__ prepends the name anyway. `rearm(name)` does setattr(envs, name, _descriptors[name]) so next access re-resolves; `rearm_all()` loops all descriptors doing same. This preserves caching semantics: env edits alone do not change attribute, only rearm+reaccess does."}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Evidence ev-f1b475055e3248a03ac7 | deepinfer/environ.py | lines:94-213 | sha256=fe2c531989c419f0b51b169a07f5ed826dcec7f95c0c5bc3a351805923c4f218\n        return EnvVar(_init)\n\n\nclass envs:\n    \"环境变量的集中定义模块\"\n\n    # -- Platform --\n    DEEPINFER_ACCELERATOR = EnvVar.str(default=\"nvidia\")\n\n    # -- Runtime --\n    DEEPINFER_COMPUTE_SUM_SMALLER_PROBS = EnvVar.bool()\n    DEEPINFER_JIT_CACHE_DIR = EnvVar.str_or_none()\n\n    # -- Distributed Communication --\n    DEEPINFER_NCCL_NUM_SMS = EnvVar.int(default=32)\n    DEEPINFER_USERBUFFER_COMM_SMS = EnvVar.int()\n    DEEPINFER_GLOO_TIMEOUT = EnvVar(lambda v: timedelta(seconds=_float(v, 14400)))\n    DEEPINFER_REARRANGE_P2P_GROUPS = EnvVar.int(default=1)\n\n    # -- MoE & Expert Parallelism --\n    DEEPINFER_OVERRIDE_NUM_EXTRA_EXPERTS = EnvVar.int()\n    DEEPINFER_EXPERT_COUNT_WINDOW_SIZE = EnvVar.int(default=100)\n    DEEPINFER_EXPERT_REARRANGEMENT_STEP_INTERVAL = EnvVar.int()\n    DEEPINFER_REARRANGE_AFTER_PREFILL_IN_NORMAL_ENGINE = EnvVar.bool()\n    DEEPINFER_MOE_LB_STAT_INTERVAL = EnvVar.int(default=128)\n    DEEPINFER_FORCE_IMBALANCE_RATIO = EnvVar.float()\n    DEEPINFER_FORCE_LOAD_BALANCE = EnvVar.bool()\n    